            <ArticleTitle>Peripheral neuropathy: evidence-based treatment of a complex disorder.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>32-9; quiz 39-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/01.NPR.0000413482.44379.ff</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Peripheral neuropathy (PN) is a common and often progressive condition frequently seen in primary care. The chronic pain associated with PN, or neuropathic pain, can significantly diminish patients' quality of life and be challenging to treat.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
